 ('ENT_SAB_ALMAQAH','member_of','ENT_AKS_PANTHEON','high','Almaqah was worshipped in the Dʿmt kingdom of pre-Aksumite Ethiopia.','SRC_MUNRO_HAY_AKSUM'),
